{"id":"00282","root":"uni00282_1","name":{"ja":"レティシア","en":"Leticia"},"title":{"ja":"【ニューイヤー】","en":"【New Year】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ニューイヤー】 レティシア","en":"【New Year】 Leticia"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-12-31","limited":true,"characterId":65,"profile":{"ja":"米連の特殊技能開発により能力を発現させた少女。幼いころから米連に所属し、兵士としての訓練を受けていたが、ある日、特秘任務と称された米連の実験に参加し、アクア・ミストレスを発現させる。これは自分の血液を液体に浸透させる事で、自分の身体の一部のように操る事ができるという力。以降は裏社会での戦闘を行うチームに参加している。クールで物事に熱くなることは少なく、特に任務中は命令に忠実で、感情を表に出さずにこなす。善悪の判断は軍に委ね、非道な任務も感情を殺して進めるが、時として民家や民間人の子供まで襲うやり方に、わずかな疑問を抱き始めている。しかし任務のためやってきた日本の米軍基地は、彼女の所属チームとは随分と雰囲気が違っていた。時は折しも正月、ニューイヤー気分に浮かれた基地隊員たちは、レティシアに「折角ジャパンに来たのだから」と半ば強引に晴れ着を着せてしまった。","en":"They are a girl who manifested abilities through the US forces' special skill development program. They have been part of the US forces since childhood, receiving soldier training, but one day participated in a classified mission experiment and manifested the Aqua Mistress power, which lets them infiltrate their own blood into liquid and control it as if it were part of their body. Since then they have joined a team that fights in the underworld. They are cool and rarely get passionate; especially during missions they are loyal to orders and carry out tasks without showing emotion. They leave moral judgment to the military, suppressing feelings even on cruel missions, though they have begun to harbor slight doubts about tactics that even attack civilian homes and children. However, the US base in Japan they arrived at for a mission had a very different atmosphere from their team. It happened to be New Year's, and the base personnel, in a festive mood, half-forcefully dressed Leticia in formal wear, saying \"Since you're finally in Japan…\"."},"illustrator":"相川亜利砂","voiceActor":"和葉","forms":[{"id":"uni00282_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1198,2396],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[96,192],"def":[131,262],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge"